      "content": "Administering a different medication without consulting your doctor can be risky. The two drugs have different primary uses and taking one isn't necessarily safe with another, especially since both affect your central nervous system. Over-the-counter sleeping pills can carry their own risks and should be discussed with a healthcare professional. It's important to treat your body with care, especially when it comes to pain and sleep management.",
